sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant Control as Control PostgreSQL
    participant Storage as Blob adapter
    participant Execution as Execution PostgreSQL
    User->>CLI: run create, profile and dataset source
    opt Inline or file source
        CLI->>Storage: Validate and publish immutable dataset
    end
    CLI->>Control: Freeze creating run and exact evaluator and placement identities
    loop Bounded verified case files
        CLI->>Storage: Verify cases and publish immutable chunk, gate and configuration files
        CLI->>Control: Fence ownership and acknowledge progress
    end
    CLI->>Control: Publish verified plan root
    alt Prepare only
        CLI-->>User: Creating run with ready plan, execution held
    else Execution requested
        loop Bounded metadata pages
            CLI->>Execution: Idempotently seed chunks, references and gate counts
            CLI->>Control: Acknowledge contiguous admission cursor
        end
        CLI->>Execution: Independently verify exact local chunk membership
        alt Every placement verified
            CLI->>Control: Atomically publish routes, cursors and pending state
            CLI-->>User: Pending run
        else Interrupted or unavailable placement
            CLI-->>User: Creating run and recovery progress
            Note over Control: Coordinator resumes requested admission
        end
    end
